GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Live stories from Gemini when there is no Anthropic key. Off unless this says exactly "on";
# GEMINI_API_KEY alone (the World Builder scripts use it) never turns it on. Only for made-up
# demo profiles: Google's Gemini API terms do not allow it in apps meant for children, the free
# tier may use what it gets to improve Google's models, and the parent consent names only Anthropic.
# GEMINI_STORIES=on
